   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bangkok, Thailand - November 5, 2011: Young thai family with dog paddling a makeshift foam raft through heavily flooded street in Arun Amarin, Unusual heavy rains in July 2011 combined with high tides of the sea triggered massive flooding in Thailand. Approximately one third of all provinces are affected.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
